flowchart LR
  U[End User / API Client] --> ID[JWT Identity + Purpose]
  ID --> QP[Query Policy + Prompt Guard]
  QP --> MR[Known-Scope Memory Read\nPolicy + Preference]
  QP --> QT[Guarded Multi-Query]
  QT --> VS[Vector Retrieval]
  QT --> LS[BM25 / Lexical Retrieval]
  VS --> RRF[Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
  LS --> RRF
  RRF --> RR[Deterministic Reranker]
  RR --> CQ[Corrective Quality Gate + Fallback]
  CQ --> SCB[Secure Context Broker\nAuthorization before LLM exposure]
  MR --> PA[Bounded Prompt Assembly]
  SCB --> PA
  CS[Bounded Recent Conversation] --> PA
  PA --> AG[Bounded Agent Runtime]
  AG --> NV[NVIDIA Model Gateway\nRetry + Circuit Breaker]
  AG --> TOOLS[Typed Read-Only Tools]
  NV --> DLP[Output DLP + Citation Postcondition]
  TOOLS --> DLP
  DLP --> RESP[Typed End-User Response]
  RESP --> TR[Append-Only Run Trace]
  RESP --> PG[Explicit Memory Promotion API]
  PG --> GATE[Promotion Gate\nScope + Provenance + Confidence]
  GATE --> MEM[(Typed Durable Memory\nPolicy / Preference / Fact / Episode)]
  GATE --> OUT[(Transactional Outbox)]
  MEM --> MR
